WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.940
let's get right into audience questions for
the week.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:10.530
The first one, Hey, David, is the era of the
social justice warrior or SJ w over, you're

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.769
just not hearing much about

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:12.769
them anymore.

00:00:12.769 --> 00:00:15.210
This is funny because you could interpret
this in two ways.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:20.810
Are you saying, are there no more social justice
warriors or you could be saying is the right

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:25.239
no longer obsessed with talking about social
justice warriors and here's the reality.

00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:27.509
This was always a charade.

00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:33.820
The right seems to have moved on from focusing
on so-called toxic SJWs.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:39.390
I don't believe that anything has really changed
on the left, which is most people on the left

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.140
understand the importance of justice in its
different forms.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.210
This could be social justice, this could be
judiciary justice.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:46.510
This is economic justice.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:47.720
This is environmental justice.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.470
I don't think anything has changed.

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:52.470
Most of the left understands that and prioritizes
it.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:58.000
The right made a lot of headway and got a
lot of attention and built entire campus speaking

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.869
tours around the idea of wanting to go around
and trigger so-called SJWs who want to shut

00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:11.630
down, debate and prevent people from speaking
and talk about, you know, um, uh, a small

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:14.610
number of issues and a particularly toxic
and divisive way.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.170
Do those people exist on the left?

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.189
Sure.

00:01:18.189 --> 00:01:19.189
Anything exists.

00:01:19.189 --> 00:01:21.530
We've got a country, a country of 340 million
people.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:29.259
You have a everything from neo-Nazis to authoritarian
leftists to, I mean, like it wasn't, everything

00:01:29.259 --> 00:01:30.259
exists.

00:01:30.259 --> 00:01:37.359
The question always was to what degree does
this slice of the left known pejoratively

00:01:37.359 --> 00:01:45.819
as the SJWs by some on the right, um, really
affect policy and represent large swaths of

00:01:45.819 --> 00:01:46.819
the left.

00:01:46.819 --> 00:01:49.990
And the reality is it never actually did.

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:54.590
And we always would hear about, you know,
individual instances at schools or someone

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.569
who was triggered by this or that.

00:01:56.569 --> 00:02:01.420
And it was always putting the microscope on
something that the right decided was going

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:06.799
to be advantageous for them to focus on, to
make the left seem on hinge and whatever.

00:02:06.799 --> 00:02:08.330
Here's the reality.

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:14.260
There are people on, uh, in, in politics,
on all sides of political, of the political

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:20.830
spectrum who will sometimes myopically and
to the detriment of their broader movement,

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:27.220
focusing on some particular element that misses
the forest for the trees or go too far.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:28.220
That's not new.

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.380
That happens on the left and it happens on
the right.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:35.530
The reality is that on the left, most people
want reasonable conversations.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.610
Most people want diversity of ideas.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.420
Most of the left is for free speech.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:45.310
A huge swath of the left is really quite centrist
and they don't even, I mean, listen, I wish

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:51.420
they were more to the left, but the entire
Biden, Hillary contingent on the left, uh,

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:58.030
are, are by and large, not even tangentially
involved in what the right likes to call the

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.120
crazy SJWs.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.400
So nothing has really changed.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.430
The right seems to have moved on, and now
they're talking about other things.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.900
They're talking about Trump derangement syndrome.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.990
They're talking about, uh, you know, the,
maybe they want to talk about violent leftists

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:18.100
even though of course the vast majority of
political violence actually comes from the

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.100
right.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.830
So my message to you is it's not that the
era of the SJW is over.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:27.930
Uh, it's that there never really was an era
other than the fact that most of the left

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:33.471
finds it really important to support justice
in all of its forms where we see it, it's

00:03:33.471 --> 00:03:36.070
actually very much tied in with identity politics.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.070
Right?

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.070
The right.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.940
You hear much less about that as well.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:45.560
Uh, the right liked for around the same time
that they were talking about theS crazy SJWs

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.300
they were talking about the identity politics
left.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:55.730
Are there people on the left who use identity
as a cudgel or mallet with which to beat people

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:58.930
and to shut down debate and to exclude voices
from conversations?

00:03:58.930 --> 00:03:59.930
Absolutely.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.010
Have I experienced it myself?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:09.460
I have a, I have been told that my Jewish
identity is irrelevant because it is actually

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:14.410
the fact that I learned English young enough
and my Jewish identity and my immigrant from

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:19.040
Argentina identity are irrelevant because
I speak English without an accent and therefore

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:24.639
I basically pass as just a white guy, which
is a relevant analysis in many ways when we're

00:04:24.639 --> 00:04:30.200
talking about privilege, but therefore my
views on X or Y are not valid or shouldn't

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.200
be listened to.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.620
I've experienced that, but I recognize that
it is a very small fraction of the left that

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.210
believes that stuff.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:42.610
Most of the left understands that identity
matters.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:49.970
People's identity can give them a unique lens
through which to look at a problem, a policy

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.930
problem, a societal problem, whatever the
case may be, but it needs to be used to add

00:04:54.930 --> 00:05:02.200
to the conversation, not to suppress conversation
and you're also hearing a lot less about toxic

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:06.590
identity politics from the right about the
left to the extent that it existed before

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:07.860
it still exists.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:12.280
It's relatively small and hopefully we are
moving past that.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.681
Although the right, we'll just become obsessed
with something else.

